{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1kJxgfq43S3tYrSBBPW", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'm not signing off. I reproduced two defects in the folder-management area, and the developer could not reproduce either from my steps. I also could not test the chunked text reader.\n\n**Filed reports (both returned \"could not reproduce with the steps given\"):**\n1. **Duplicate folder name leaves CREATE enabled.** In AndroidQA/Amaze, typing \"Alpha\" or \"Beta\" (both already exist) shows no error and CREATE stays enabled. Tapping it shows \"File with same name already exists\" and clears the field. Typing \"a/b\" disables CREATE and shows \"Invalid Name\", so validation-while-typing works for invalid characters but not for duplicates. I reproduced this three times.\n2. **Selection lost on rotation.** With notes.txt selected (action bar \"1\"), rotating to landscape changes the action bar to \"0\" and clears the highlight, while selection mode stays open. I reproduced this twice, including with a minimal sequence (long-press, rotate).\n\n**Checked and working:**\n- Drawer: Internal Storage, the folder bookmarks, and the media categories (Images, Documents) open the right files.\n- Category per-item Properties show the correct real location: keep.jpg and photo.jpg in `AndroidQA/Amaze`, readme.txt in `Alpha` (13 B) and `Beta` (12 B).\n- Text preview: notes.txt, report+final.txt and readme.txt show their full contents; Find in page works; the text editor survives rotation.\n- Multi-select: Select All selects all 6 items; \"Select Inverse\" (in the count dropdown, not the overflow menu) inverts the selection correctly.\n- New folder: \"a/b\" is rejected with \"Invalid Name\"; \"Gamma\" is created and appears with the correct count (3 folders, 4 files).\n\n**Not verified:** the chunked reading of large text files. None of the preconditions files is large, and I did not create one.\n\nTwo tests went to the wrong screen during the sweep, but they did not change any data. Gamma is the only folder I created. Because two reproduced defects are still open and the large-file path is untested, I did not sign off."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2494, "cache_read_input_tokens": 177247, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2494}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "30194a68-a1f2-441c-8fef-5b3eed449807", "uuid": "5484abe6-1a3b-45f1-89ae-3f36fb1badf9", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T22:52:21.892Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1kJxRnb5iutA5ZWA2ko"}
